ess the return from editor earlier happened when pref was OFF and on a *portrait* window using local per-folder sort... ugh.\n\nMaybe \"Folder local\" = \"Sort this folder locally\" — when checked, the folder browser maintains its own sort settings per folder. Hmm.\n\nWait wait. Maybe there's a real bug: The sort dialog's checkbox states get desynced from prefs after rotation or after reopen. This might be a rabbit hole. The developer already confirmed my report. Moving on.\n\nNow, focus: line duplication on Single.md. Tap Single.md."}
