ed word should duplicate its line.\n\nLet me test:\n1. Tap in editor to clear selection.\n2. Long press to select word \"deep\" (at x≈?). The text is at top-left; \"- a\" line1 y≈290, \"  - deep\" line2 y≈340. Long press at (200,340).\n3. Floating toolbar appears.\n4. Tap Duplicate lines.\n5. Observe.\n\nBut note: long-press selection toolbar appears at y=412 and might overlap the format bar at y=438? It's at y=412 with height ~? The toolbar height ~90? It may partially cover the format bar! Earlier the floating toolbar appeared at y=412 with items at y=412 (text) and the format bar icons at y=438. The floating toolbar (a rounded white bar) likely spans y≈370-455; could overlap the format icon row and intercept taps at x 920-1335 only. The Duplicate icon x=1667 is outside the toolbar width. So fine.\n\nLet me clear selection by tapping editor at (500,500)."}
