{"type": "thinking", "text": "Screenshot confirms: Folder local unchecked, Folder first checked. So my single tap on \"Folder local\" turned it off AND turned \"Folder first\" on. That's a real UI bug: tapping the Folder local row toggles Folder first instead of/in addition to itself. Wait — maybe it's not the tap mapping; maybe \"Folder local\" and \"Folder first\" are linked in the data model (e.g., \"Folder local\" is the inverse of \"Folder first\"?!). \n\nWhoa. Maybe \"Folder local\" = \"Sort folders locally (i.e., do not group)\" and \"Folder first\" = its negation! That would explain:\n- Initially Folder local unchecked + Folder first checked = folders first.\n- Tapping Folder local → checked Folder local, unchecked Folder first (my first experiment: after tapping element 1, observe showed Folder local unchecked?? Hmm).\n\nLet me re-examine the earlier anomaly:\nAfter many operations, dialog state was: Folder local checked, Folder first unchecked (that was the state when I was testing the bug). Then I tapped element 1 (Folder local) and observed: Folder local unchecked, Folder first checked. That's consistent with \"tapping Folder local toggles both\": they are inverse states.\n\nNow again: Folder local checked, Folder first unchecked → tapped Folder local → Folder local unchecked, Folder first checked. Consistent! So they ARE linked/inverse. So \"Folder local\" and \"Folder first\" are two representations of the same preference (maybe intentionally, as two different labels for different sort modes?) or a bug where both checkboxes reflect one boolean.\n\nHmm! This is a significant clue: maybe \"Folder first\" and \"Folder local\" are actually the same underlying setting and the dialog shows both. In Markor source, I now recall: The sort dialog has a \"Folder first\" checkbox and a \"Folder local\" checkbox. Hmm.\n\nWait, could it be that the \"Folder local\" option means \"Sort folders first, locally\" and is literally the same preference? Unlikely to have two labels for one setting.\n\nLet me test: In current dialog (Folder local unchecked, Folder first checked), tap \"Folder first\" (element 6). If the two are linked, this toggles Folder first off and Folder local on. Let me test."}
